      "body": "Problem: Batched completion responses report cached_tokens from only the first streamed prompt or the last non-streamed prompt. The reported value is incomplete and streaming results depend on completion order.\r\n\r\nSolution: Track streamed cached token counts by prompt index and sum non-streamed results across the batch. Add regression tests for batched and out-of-order streaming responses.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\n---\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Essential Elements of an Effective PR Description Checklist </summary>\r\n\r\n- [ ] The purpose of the PR, such as \"Fix some issue (link existing issues this PR will resolve)\".\r\n- [ ] The test plan, such as providing test command.\r\n- [ ] The test results, such as pasting the results comparison before and after, or e2e results\r\n- [ ] (Optional) The necessary documentation update, such as updating `supported_models.md` and `examples` for a new model.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n",
